eneral performance improvements", "created_date": 1628783098, "id": "4415772671823002", "version": "0.2.40", "version_code": 38, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4018602774873329", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6183588651708053"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "431530467912721"}]}, "change_log": "Changelog: - Adds the ability to export your world to 3D models. The functionality is found in the room menu. - Adds small imperfections to the brick models - Change brick rendering to be more shiny and specular - Fix bug where usernames above heads weren't rendering in multiplayer - Fix bug where the slider on the brick menu would flicker in the tutorial", "created_date": 1628280419, "id": "4398186833581586", "version": "0.2.39", "version_code": 37, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4018602774873329", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6183588651708053"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "431530467912721"}]}, "change_log": "Changelog:\n- Adds the ability to export your world to 3D models. The functionality is found in the room menu.\n- Adds small imperfections to the brick models\n- Change brick rendering to be more shiny and specular\n- Fix bug where usernames above heads weren't rendering in multiplayer\n- Fix bug where the slider on the brick menu would flicker in the tutorial", "created_date": 1628273947, "id": "4397961726937430", "version": "0.2.39", "version_code": 36, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4018602774873329", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "6183588651708053"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "431530467912721"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixes bad mesh on 2x2 corner brick\n- Fixes bad mesh on 1x4x2/3 slope\n- Fixes bug where you could grab parts of the brick menu when it was closed\n- Fixes bug where the brick menu category slider could become displaced by grabbing it and then closing the menu\n- Fixes bug where 2x2 corner brick could not be placed sometimes", "created_date": 1627581897, "id": "4374655805934689", "version": "0.2.38", "version_code": 35, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}